Vendored here so the social cover renders identically on a developer machine and
on the ubuntu-latest deploy runner. Without a pinned font, Pillow falls back to
whatever the host happens to have (Arial locally, DejaVu Sans in CI), and the
published card silently differs from the one that was designed and reviewed.
